/* ================================================================
   WORLD ATLAS — world-atlas-data.js
   Reference data for all 195 countries: 193 UN member states plus the
   Vatican City and Palestine (UN observer states, un:false).

   Fields per country:
     id / iso2      ISO 3166-1 alpha-3 (lowercase) and alpha-2 codes
     name / nameEs  common name in English and Spanish
     flag           flag emoji
     capital        capital city (capitalNote explains multi-capital cases)
     currency       ISO 4217 code + name and symbol
     population     ~2025 estimate, rounded
     region         continent, with subregion and area (km2)

   Sources: names, capitals, currencies, regions and areas from the
   public-domain mledoze/countries dataset; population figures are 2025
   estimates rounded for teaching, cross-checked against World Bank data.
   Populations change every year — they are meant to teach scale, not
   exact head counts.

   Loaded as a plain script (no fetch) so the app works fully offline.
   ================================================================ */

